  meaning_en = 'By sacrifice the gods sacrificed to sacrifice; these were the first observances. They reached the height where the ancient Sadhyas, the gods, abide. To Sri Mahaganapati, salutations: I take leave of you to your own place — for what is good, for well-being, and for your coming again. Peace, peace, peace.',
